-&nbsp;230°C&nbsp;(Printing&nbsp;temperature&nbsp;may&nbsp;vary&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;printer)</li><li>Heat&nbsp;Resistance:&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;is&nbsp;more&nbsp;heat&nbsp;resistant&nbsp;than&nbsp;traditional&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;and&nbsp;can&nbsp;withstand&nbsp;temperatures&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;60°C.</li><li>Printing&nbsp;Speed:&nbsp;Can&nbsp;be&nbsp;printed&nbsp;at&nbsp;speeds&nbsp;ranging&nbsp;from&nbsp;40&nbsp;-&nbsp;100&nbsp;mm/s.&nbsp;This&nbsp;speed&nbsp;may&nbsp;vary&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;printer&nbsp;settings&nbsp;and&nbsp;print&nbsp;type.</li><li>Shrinkage&nbsp;Rate:&nbsp;Thanks&nbsp;to&nbsp;its&nbsp;low&nbsp;shrinkage&nbsp;rate,&nbsp;there&nbsp;is&nbsp;less&nbsp;deformation&nbsp;during&nbsp;printing.</li><li>Surface&nbsp;Quality:&nbsp;Prints&nbsp;made&nbsp;with&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;have&nbsp;smoother&nbsp;and&nbsp;harder&nbsp;surfaces.</li><li>Durability:&nbsp;High&nbsp;mechanical&nbsp;strength&nbsp;provides&nbsp;impact&nbsp;resistance.&nbsp;This&nbsp;feature&nbsp;makes&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;ideal&nbsp;for&nbsp;use&nbsp;in&nbsp;more&nbsp;durable&nbsp;and&nbsp;long-lasting&nbsp;projects.</li><li>Environmentally&nbsp;Friendly:&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;biodegradable&nbsp;material&nbsp;and&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;harm&nbsp;the&nbsp;environment.&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;is&nbsp;also&nbsp;environmentally&nbsp;friendly.</li></ol><p><strong>Advantages:</strong></p><ul><li>High&nbsp;durability:&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;is&nbsp;stronger&nbsp;and&nbsp;more&nbsp;durable&nbsp;than&nbsp;traditional&nbsp;PLA.&nbsp;This&nbsp;ensures&nbsp;that&nbsp;prints&nbsp;last&nbsp;longer.</li><li>Easy&nbsp;printing:&nbsp;Since&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;more&nbsp;stable&nbsp;against&nbsp;temperature&nbsp;changes,&nbsp;problems&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;warping&nbsp;(bending)&nbsp;occur&nbsp;less&nbsp;during&nbsp;printing.</li><li>Better&nbsp;surface&nbsp;quality:&nbsp;Prints&nbsp;made&nbsp;with&nbsp;PLA&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;are&nbsp;generally&nbsp;smoother&nbsp;and&nbsp;